    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombolion</strong> is an arcade zombie shooter where <i>you</i> are the last sheriff standing in the entire county, fighting to defend a top-secret research bunker and uncover the truth behind a deadly virus \u2014 using the finest scientific and diplomatic methods humanity has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Methods like: machine gun bursts, grenades, automated turrets, gear upgrades, and plenty of tactics that would make any international committee lose their minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no time for talking things through \u2014 just bullets, explosions, and pure survival instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Brutal firepower:</strong> Machine guns, grenades, turrets, upgrades \u2014 all the \u201cscientific\u201d tools you\u2019ll need to tear through the undead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/d2a8a7dbf61c8a8c803d3b7b7f3473ee.poster.avif?t=1753538036\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/d2a8a7dbf61c8a8c803d3b7b7f3473ee.webm?t=1753538036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/d2a8a7dbf61c8a8c803d3b7b7f3473ee.mp4?t=1753538036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Bunker defense:</strong> Fortify your bunker, build up your defenses, and hold out against endless zombie waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/0173bdd3fb639181483bb2c658725e74.poster.avif?t=1753538036\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/0173bdd3fb639181483bb2c658725e74.webm?t=1753538036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/0173bdd3fb639181483bb2c658725e74.mp4?t=1753538036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore the map:</strong> Scavenge vital resources, expand your control, and stay ahead of the infection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/1bf5044a291e8af731d5d2025b2bfc5d.poster.avif?t=1753538036\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/1bf5044a291e8af731d5d2025b2bfc5d.webm?t=1753538036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/1bf5044a291e8af731d5d2025b2bfc5d.mp4?t=1753538036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Massive zombie hordes:</strong> No peace talks here \u2014 expect nonstop waves of brain-hungry enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/c4c145125c3007794533e45d83707936.poster.avif?t=1753538036\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/c4c145125c3007794533e45d83707936.webm?t=1753538036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/c4c145125c3007794533e45d83707936.mp4?t=1753538036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade system:</strong> Level up your gear, defenses, and everything else that keeps you breathing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Save the world:</strong> Uncover the mystery behind the virus \u2014 before it\u2019s game over for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/6e53cba7d9a06eae7c6b2309dc66cb60.poster.avif?t=1753538036\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/6e53cba7d9a06eae7c6b2309dc66cb60.webm?t=1753538036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825270/extras/6e53cba7d9a06eae7c6b2309dc66cb60.mp4?t=1753538036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
